ng is that that  you we have we have that creativity not  just to solve the problems with facing I  mean kids are learning yeah it's not  ideal in the classroom with friends but  there we're we're instructing people all  these are innovations will America  brought about in many ways are made it  possible but the other thing that's  happening is they're working on  solutions to this problem I'm I I  believe the brightest minds in the world  the bride's minds in this country  thinking about parking leaking with a  vaccine how can we come up with an  antiviral how can we make ventilators  and you're already seen some of these  companies turn it around and take small  things and repurpose it if it to be  between waiters and medical protective  gear and so forth so that extraordinary  power is still there when our minds are  behind a United purpose and you see that  it's evident people aren't just sitting  at home saying when is the government  gonna come up with an answer the media  might be asking that but but every day  people run out and answering the  question themselves in their own  communities that's a very unique  American attribute the one that I'm glad  we still have I love that answer and  Senator I thank you for taking the time  and stay safe  and hopefully we'll be able to do this  in person sometime absolutely thank you  if you're looking for more honest and  thoughtful conversations about politics  instead of non-stop yelling check out  our politics playlist and if you want to  watch full interviews on a variety of  topics watch our full episode playlist  all right over here  and to get notified of all future videos  be sure to subscribe and click the  notification bell
 

